{"created": "2026-11-09T23:29:53.124115+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-09T23:29:55.843714+00:00", "id": 24094073, "conceptrecid": "24094072", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24094073", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.24094072", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24094073", "metadata": {"title": "Data release for \"Analysis of GWTC-3 with multiple quasicircular models\": SEOBNRv5PHM", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24094073", "publication_date": "2026-11-09", "description": "<p>Posterior samples and RIFT likelihood evaluations from a reanalysis of GWTC-3 binary black hole events with RIFT, using the SEOBNRv5PHM waveform model. Data release underpinning \"Analysis of GWTC-3 with multiple quasicircular models\" (N. Manning and R. O'Shaughnessy).</p><p>Each <code>GW*_SEOBNRv5PHM.h5</code> file is a PESummary HDF5 file for one event: posterior samples, priors, PSDs, calibration envelopes and the RIFT configuration. <code>likelihood_evaluations_SEOBNRv5PHM.zip</code> holds one RIFT marginalized-likelihood evaluation file (<code>.net</code>) per event.</p><p>A companion record holds the same events analysed with IMRPhenomTPHM.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Manning, Noah", "affiliation": "Rochester Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0009-0001-1864-6972"}, {"name": "O'Shaughnessy, Richard", "affiliation": "Rochester Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0000-0001-5832-8517"}], "keywords": ["gravitational waves", "GWTC-3", "RIFT", "parameter estimation", "SEOBNRv5PHM"], "version": "1.0.0", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "24094072"}}]}}, "title": "Data release for \"Analysis of GWTC-3 with multiple quasicircular models\": SEOBNRv5PHM", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24094073", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24094073", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24094073?preview=1", 